{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27808","headline":"观淬龙泉劒 · 裴夷直","name":"观淬龙泉劒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欧冶将成器，风胡幸见逢。\n发硎思剸玉，投水化爲龙。\n讵肯藏深匣，终朝用刜钟。\n莲花生宝锷，秋日励霜锋。\n链质才三尺，吹毛过百重。\n击磨如不倦，提握愿长从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴夷直","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}